Flipper Zero source-compatibility layer for the YP3 Rockbox port
================================================================

Flipper apps are built unmodified (or nearly) as ordinary Rockbox plugins:
one .rock per game, each linked with the shared layer (flipper_*.c, headers
in include/ with the Flipper SDK names). The layer provides only what the
ported games use: Furi (ticks, delay, timers, message queues by value,
mutexes, threads, pubsub, records, FuriString), the Canvas/ViewPort/Gui
drawing path (128x64 or 64x128 mono, expanded to RGB565 and centred),
input (press/release/short/long/repeat derived from key state), storage,
Flipper Format and notification stubs. Sound is not implemented.

Each game adds a glue.c with a `struct flipper_game` (name, help, credits,
key mapping: pause-menu key, UP-hold as Back, SELECT tap/hold split). The layer supplies the start menu (Start/Resume, Help, About,
Playback Control, Quit) and the pause menu: hold DOWN or SELECT for half a
second (per game; SELECT is the power key, so never longer).

genfont.py generates flipper_fonts.c from the Rockbox BDF fonts.

Ported games (upstream, commit, license). Ard-Drivin and ArduGolf have
Flipper ports too, but ship from the Arduboy layer (apps/plugins/arduboy).
- asteroids/  github.com/antirez/flipper-asteroids
              ddedda40206892257b685b4069e670b1be810b0e  BSD-2-Clause
              (app.c unmodified)
- mystic/     github.com/apfxtech/FlipperMysticBalloon (port of Team a.r.g.'s
              Mystic Balloon)  7cc0c932622ae1286d92bc27f445216a4df94ddb  MIT.
              Sources unmodified.
- fzsudoku/   github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins, non_catalog_apps/sudoku
              (Sudoku by @profelis, Copyright (c) 2023)  MIT. The port's exact
              base commit was not recorded; the path's latest upstream commit
              is a1884147eab65b2db1f9db9c6a8c2a7dfe4ddc6a. Digits drawn as
              3x5 bitmaps (the layer has no canvas_draw_glyph).
- citybloxx/  github.com/Milk-Cool/fz-citybloxx
              2efc2ed6a9b461fb94f94d43ebd1f37ff3c2aabd  MIT.
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): ground has one line (the second
              was uninitialised heap: huge lines, stutter, hangs); the score
              uses %u (no 'h' modifier in the YP3 printf); rotation in single
              precision; 20 ms redraws and 25 ms fall steps with sub-pixel
              remainders; the old tower is freed on restart; tick and
              balance fixes.
- stackattack/ github.com/Negenii/flipper-stack-attack
              658e60e82930888e8a9c703bac34a4e83a7b0db5  MIT.
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): the sound tables use the layer's
              NotificationMessage; LED and vibration are no-ops (the Options
              entries do nothing here).
- nwcrawl/    github.com/rseufert/nw_crawl
              7f53a53b3c94309f19112c94d04039a8ab0f3637  MIT.
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): a second Back while aiming opens the
              street map (SELECT tap = OK, hold = Back); shorter title texts.
- furiousbirds/ github.com/bmstr-ru/furious-birds
              79a8506a7b42c0ad96833b82bf65f44b0005b9b4  MIT.
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): single-precision maths; logo and
              game ticks run from timers instead of threads; the About
              widget is dropped (the layer has an About entry); sound is on
              by default; OK also restarts after game over. Icons generated
              by genicons.py. flipper_views.c (View/ViewDispatcher)
              is listed by the games that use it.
- nupogodi/   github.com/sionyx/flipper_nupogodi
              afdae127be3498ea5104a13f157aac0512e80bf2  MIT.
              Changes: the game tick runs from the timer (no worker thread);
              the pause widget is dropped (the layer menu pauses); sound is
              on at the start. Icons generated by genicons.py.
- fliprogue/  github.com/Abzac/fliprogue
              2107c599077c80456dedc5e04d3a3ca6ea691662  GPL-3.0.
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): sscanf replaced by a hand parser;
              the LED messages are inert. SELECT tap = OK, hold = Back.
              The layer now hands out a non-NULL notification record.
- racegame/   github.com/mrc19056/flipper-race-game
              794197bedd786c35db1801895743f53dfb2c9a39  MIT.
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): no vibration stall; srand from the
              tick (no DWT). SELECT tap = OK, hold = Back.
- arkanoid/   github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  base_pack/arkanoid
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  GPL-3.0 (the
              repository's licence; the app file carries no header of its
              own). arkanoid_game.c unmodified.
- stackgame/  github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  non_catalog_apps/stack_game
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  MIT (bergr22).
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): saves under the data dir; fabsf.
              SELECT tap = OK, hold = Back.
- bomberduck/ github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  base_pack/bomberduck
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  MIT. bomberduck.c
              unmodified; icons generated by genicons.py. Sound: the
              level-clear / death beeps only (upstream has no other notes).
- simonsays/  github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  non_catalog_apps/SimonSays
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  GPL-3.0. The dolphin
              artwork is Flipper Devices' (the repository's licence applies).
              Change: the save file lives in the data dir. Icons generated
              by genicons.py.
- oregontrail/ github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  non_catalog_apps/oregon_trail
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  MIT. Sources
              unmodified. SELECT tap = OK, hold = Back (so hold-OK fast
