- flipperhero/ github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  non_catalog_apps/flipper_hero
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  MIT (Mentoster).
              Changes (marked "Rockbox:"): state, config and records are
              zeroed (upstream read uninitialised heap and crashed); sound is
              on when there is no saved config; the music worker is timer-driven
              (no thread). flipper_hero_icons.[ch] are generated by
              genicons.py from upstream icons/ and icons/stratagems/
              (+ large/); the PNGs are not copied (740 KB).
- flappybird/ github.com/xMasterX/all-the-plugins  base_pack/flappy_bird
              532859b377dc238df69f765f49adc4359e5eb950  GPL-3 (repository
